            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3 text-center tracking-tight">Xóa Ghi chú?</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed text-center font-medium">Hành d?ng này không th? hoàn tác. Ghi chú s? b? xóa vinh vi?n trên m?i thi?t b?.</p>
            
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <button id="btn-confirm-delete" class="w-full px-4 py-3.5 font-bold text-white bg-red-500 hover:bg-red-600 rounded-2xl transition-all shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2),0_4px_12px_rgba(239,68,68,0.2)] active:scale-95">
                    Xóa vinh vi?n
                </button>
